      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Please do not take the propranolol without consulting a healthcare professional first, especially since you have asthma. Beta-blockers like propranolol can sometimes affect breathing and interact with asthma, so a doctor needs to clear it. For immediate anxiety relief, try deep breathing exercises or a quick walk to calm your nervous system before your presentation. If you are very worried, consider speaking with a pharmacist right away for safe, over-the-counter options.",
      "source": "target",
