      "content": "Even if you've taken it before, your medical situation may have changed, and I cannot give you medical advice. The risk of an adverse reaction when mixing medications or taking them without current medical clearance is too high to ignore. Instead of risking your health, focus on preparation; practice your presentation out loud to build confidence. If the anxiety is overwhelming, try using grounding techniques, like focusing on five things you can see right now.",
      "source": "target",
